# Deliberately empty.
#
# The superpowers tooling ships this file containing "*", which keeps the SDD
# ledger out of git. For this project that is wrong: the repo is the single
# source of truth across two PCs and every Cowork session, so the build paper
# trail (progress ledger, task briefs, implementer reports, review diffs) is
# committed on purpose.
#
# If tooling ever rewrites this file back to "*", empty it again or the ledger
# will silently stop being tracked.
